%% TECH-014 Test suite over its time budget
%% How a browser test gets the admin cookie now: the form once per run, the saved cookie in every test.
flowchart TD
    A[npm run test:local starts] --> B[global-setup.ts signs in with the site password]
    B --> C{Local test server?}
    C -- yes --> D[Signs in on /admin through the form, saves playwright/.auth/admin.json]
    C -- no --> E[Only the site cookie is saved]
    D --> F[Test calls adminSignIn]
    F --> G[Adds the saved admin cookie, opens /admin]
    G --> H{Parent named?}
    H -- yes --> I[Chooses the parent on the page]
    H -- no --> J[Goes on from the admin start]
    K[Tests of the sign-in itself] --> L[Start without the admin cookie, sign in through the form]
